## ⚠️ Risk Mitigation

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|-----------|
| Social URLs may change | Use well-documented official share endpoints; use Web Share API as modern alternative |
| Cross-origin policy issues | Use `window.open()` which is allowed; no fetch to external APIs |
| Performance impact | Minimal - just DOM elements and click handlers; no external scripts |
| Accessibility concerns | Use semantic HTML (buttons), ARIA labels, keyboard navigation support |
| Mobile UX | Implement Web Share API fallback for native mobile share |

---

