- [ ] Screen reader announces button labels correctly
- [ ] No console errors or warnings
- [ ] Passes lint checks (`npm run lint`)
- [ ] Web Share API fallback works on mobile
- [ ] No performance regression (Lighthouse score maintained)
- [ ] Tested across browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)

